    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n*   Choose a topic, concept, or scenario you'd like the AI to generate text about.\r\n*   Craft a prompt asking the AI to summarize content, focusing on length or key details.\r\n*   Ask the AI to explain a concept to a radically different audience (e.g., a friend, a toddler, a scientist, a historical figure).\r\n*   Write a descriptive prompt for the AI to create a vivid scene or scenario.\r\n*   Experiment with asking the AI to adapt text by changing its style, tone, or point of view.\r\n*   Come up with your own unique text generation challenge for the AI.\r\n*   Observe how the AI's responses change based on the specific constraints and details in your prompts.",
